# 10 - Query Defaults — v1.0.2 Salary Receipt Focal Revalidation

## Date: 2026-07-16

## Defaults (no params)

```http
GET /api/salary-receipts
```

Response:
```json
{
  "value": [],
  "count": 0
}
```

Status: 200 ✅

## Explicit Values

```http
GET /api/salary-receipts?limit=1&includeReversed=true
```

Status: 200 ✅
Response: `{ "value": [], "count": 0 }` (empty because no data)

## Negative Cases

| Query | Expected | Actual |
|-------|----------|--------|
| `limit=0` | 400 | 400 ✅ |
| `limit=101` | 400 | 400 ✅ |
| `limit=abc` | 400 | 400 ✅ |
| `limit=1.5` | 400 | 400 ✅ |
| `includeReversed=yes` | 400 | 400 ✅ |

## Conclusion

Query schema remediation working correctly. Defaults applied, validation rejecting invalid values.
